#: core/ui/settings_new.cpp:3201
msgid ""
"UI Theme\n"
"Changes the overall look and contrast of the UI. Built-in themes are bundled presets.\n"
"Use Create Theme to copy the selected preset or custom theme and customize your own version.\n"
"Custom themes are saved in the themes folder in the configuration directory."
msgstr ""
"界面主题\n"
"更改界面的整体外观和对比度。内置主题是随程序附带的预设。\n"
"使用“创建主题”可复制所选预设或自定义主题，并创建自己的版本。\n"
"自定义主题会保存在配置目录中的 themes 文件夹里。"

